          "reasonCode": "documented-sensitive-one-way",
          "reviewer": "endstate-maintainers",
          "reviewedOn": "2026-07-22",
          "evidence": "Authored module notes: Captures Proton VPN user preferences (AppSettings.json) from %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Proton\\ProtonVPN - protocol selection, auto-connect rules, split-tunneling, and UI state. Auth tokens, session credentials, certificate material, logs, and cache are excluded. Confidence: medium - config path inferred from Proton VPN Windows conventions; AppSettings.json name is consistent with Proton's .NET/WPF app pattern. Authored secret warning: Proton VPN stores authentication tokens and session credentials in Credentials and Session directories. These are account-bound and must never be auto-restored - restoring them on another machine would expose the user's VPN account session. Re-authenticate after rebuilding. Authored excluded secret or machine-bound paths: %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Proton\\ProtonVPN\\Credentials, %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Proton\\ProtonVPN\\Session, %APPDATA%\\Proton\\ProtonVPN\\Credentials, %APPDATA%\\Proton\\ProtonVPN\\Session"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
